{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs6GGAdEUtwAcCydZ5dp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`get_metadata_for_wheel()` now reads only the member `{dist_info_name}/METADATA` that matches the wheel's filename, so vendored `.dist-info` directories are ignored. The new tests pass. The full suite has 2 failures, in `test_bootstrapper_iterative.py` and `test_constraints.py`.\n\nI confirmed the `test_bootstrapper_iterative.py` failure also happens with my changes stashed. I didn't re-run `test_constraints.py::test_add_constraint_conflict` against a clean tree. I didn't touch constraints code, but it is not confirmed as pre-existing.\n\nI did not run `ruff` or `mypy`, because neither is installed in `.venv`. The new code may need formatting or type fixes under `hatch run lint:fix` and `hatch run mypy:check`.\n\n**What changed**\n- **Helpers:** `src/fromager/pkgmetadata/pep376.py` adds `verbatim_dist_name()` and `dist_info_name()`, both exported from `fromager.pkgmetadata`. Both validate with `parse_wheel_filename`, so bad filenames or non-wheel extensions raise `InvalidWheelFilename`.\n- **`candidate.py`:** `_wheel_metadata_path(url)` takes the last path segment of the URL, ignoring query string and fragment, and returns `{dist_info_name}/METADATA`. `get_metadata_for_wheel()` reads exactly that member and raises `ValueError` if it is missing.\n- **Reuse:** `wheels.py` and `dependencies.py` now call `verbatim_dist_name()` instead of splitting the filename themselves.\n- **Tests:** `tests/test_pkgmetadata_pep376.py` is new. `tests/test_pep658_support.py` gains tests for the URL path, a wheel with a vendored dist-info alongside the real one, and the missing-member case.\n\nI also URL-decode the filename segment, so a wheel URL containing `%2B` for `+` still maps to the right member name. You didn't ask for that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9950,"cache_read_input_tokens":66309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9950},"output_tokens":693,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eceaf3de-7d06-4d08-9086-b413d5acbc73","uuid":"73ecbbf7-bc09-424a-a792-a1b86087f784","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:54:14.812Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs6GFtG7qYhfBrLhfMrk"}
